<title>BELGIUM: EU experts to discuss agrimoney, single currency.</title>
<headline>EU experts to discuss agrimoney, single currency.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Union experts' group is due to start discussion on Wednesday on agrimonetary options to prepare for the introduction of a single currency in 1999, EU diplomats said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Group will be chaired by the Commission which is due to produce a proposal by early 1998,&quot; said one diplomat.</p>
<p>One major issue to be addressed is relations between countries which are in the single currency system and those who are out.</p>
</text>
